            <description><![CDATA[<p>URL: <a href="https://theeducatorsroom.com/has-violence-against-teachers-become-accepted-by-society/">https://theeducatorsroom.com/has-violence-against-teachers-become-accepted-by-society/</a>, See on <a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49877813">Hacker News</a></p>
<div id="readability-page-1" class="page"><section id="content">
		<main id="main">

			
	<div>
		
