            <title><![CDATA[37,500 border drawings: a map of the world as people remember it (159 pts)]]></title>
            <link>https://www.habibicode.org/thedrawnworld</link>
            <guid>49875142</guid>
            <pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 08:35:10 GMT</pubDate>
